  "title": "Indonesian Chicken Skewers with Peanut Sauce (Satay Ayam)",
  "description": "Satay ayam is a sweet and salty Indonesian peanut sauce. Serve with pan-fried or grilled chicken skewers for an irresistible summer appetizer.",
  "authors": [
    "lenakurniasih"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-03-05T00:08:50-05:00",
